Batch 2: reviews + discount codes + featured banner + related products

Reviews (klantbeoordelingen):
- Migration 0025: shop.reviews tabel met status enum (pending/approved/
  rejected) + indexes + RLS (publieke read enkel approved, public insert
  enkel pending, admin full).
- lib/shop/reviews.ts: listApprovedReviewsForPhoto, aggregateReviews,
  listAllReviews, setReviewStatus.
- ReviewsSection.tsx: client component met aggregate (gemiddelde +
  sterren), reviews-lijst met "Achat verifie" badge, en submit-form
  met sterren-selector + naam/email/titel/comment + rate-limit
  (5/uur per IP). Geport van Allard.
- Server-action submitReview + verified-purchase auto-detect (matcht
  email tegen paid orders met dezelfde photo_id).
- Admin moderation page /admin/boutique/reviews: pending-eerst, kan
  approuveren / rejeter / opnieuw pending zetten.

Discount codes:
- Migration 0025: shop.discount_codes (kind percent/fixed_amount, value,
  min_subtotal, max_uses, expires_at, is_active) + shop.discount_redemptions
  (log per gebruik).
- lib/shop/discount-codes.ts: listDiscountCodes, getDiscountByCode,
  evaluateDiscount, validateDiscount, recordRedemption.
- Admin /admin/boutique/discounts: tabel met inline edit (code/type/
  valeur/min/expire/active) + nouveau-form. Volledige CRUD.
- CheckoutFormClient: nieuw promo-code blok in summary met live
  preview via previewDiscount server-action. Toont discount-regel +
  removeknop.
- prepareShopOrder action: server-side hervalidatie van de code,
  bewaart discount_code + discount_cents op order, logt redemption
  + bumpt uses_count.

Featured banner:
- Migration 0025: shop.photos.is_featured + featured_order kolommen
  + filtered index.
- lib/shop/photos.ts: listFeaturedShopPhotos(limit) helper.
- Boutique landing toont nieuwe "Coups de coeur de Jean-Pierre" strip
  bovenaan met max 6 highlight-foto's, alleen als admin er gemarkeerd
  heeft (Sparkles icoon, 6-koloms grid).

Related products:
- Photo detail-pagina toont onderaan "Vous aimerez aussi" met 4 andere
  foto's: zelfde species voorrang, anders willekeurig.

Admin sidebar:
- Nieuwe links: Codes promo + Avis clients (met pending-badge).

